---
title: Getting started
pageSlug: getting-started
mod: structure-encyclopedia
section: getting-started
order: 1
---

1. Craft the **Structure Encyclopedia**: Book + Compass + Amethyst Shard (or take it from the creative tab).
2. Open it with the item or the keybind (default **K**, configurable).
3. Explore — when you enter a catalogued structure, an action-bar message confirms the unlock.
4. Return to the book to read the page.

Pages start locked as `???`. The index is a paged grid of structure icons. Open a page for lore, mobs, and notable loot (icons with hover names). Vanilla coverage ships in the jar.
